*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0004
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-09-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-10-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 246
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0004.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    05 ACCT-TYP           PIC X.
    *> AVERAGE MONTHLY BALANCE
    05 AVG-BALANCE        PIC 9(7)V99.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 FEE-WAIVER-FLG     PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 MTH-FEE            PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM WAIVE-FEE
    DISPLAY "FEE-WAIVER-FLG=" FEE-WAIVER-FLG
    DISPLAY "MTH-FEE=" MTH-FEE
    STOP RUN.
WAIVE-FEE.
    *> MONTHLY FEE WAIVER
    IF ACCT-TYP = 'G'
       OR ACCT-TYP = 'P'
       OR AVG-BALANCE >= 1500
        MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVER-FLG
        MOVE 0.00 TO MTH-FEE
    ELSE
        MOVE 12.00 TO MTH-FEE
    END-IF.
